//! The `background-clip` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets
//! whether an element's background extends underneath its border box, padding box, or content box.
//!
//! Initial: border-box. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: <bg-clip>#
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-backgrounds-4/#propdef-background-clip
//!
//! Author guide:
